.20 68.61 L471.00 67.62 L479.80 66.70 L488.60 65.85 L497.40 65.05 L506.20 64.30 L515.00 63.60\"></path><path class=\"fig-muted\" id=\"o2-guide\" d=\"M207 50 V225\" style=\"stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-dasharray:4 4\"></path><circle class=\"fig-accent\" id=\"o2-neutral-dot\" cx=\"207\" cy=\"137.5\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle class=\"fig-danger\" id=\"o2-acid-dot\" cx=\"207\" cy=\"169.87105001806557\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg>\n<p class=\"readout\">pH 7.4 <b id=\"o2-neutral\">50%</b> · pH 7.2 <b id=\"o2-acid\">32%</b></p>\n<p class=\"legend\"><span><span class=\"sw fit\"></span>pH 7.4</span> <span>낮게 그려진 선은 pH 7.2</span></p>\n<p>곡선과 수치는 pH의 효과를 읽기 위한 개념 모형이에요.</p>\n<div class=\"widget-static\" hidden=\"\"><figure class=\"figure\"><svg id=\"widget-o2-static-1\" viewbox=\"0 0 560 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"두 산소 해리 곡선에서 30 mmHg를 비교\"><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M75 50 V225 H515\"></path><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M75 50 H68 M75 137.5 H68 M75 225 H68\"></path><text x=\"45\" y=\"54\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><text x=\"45\" y=\"142\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50</text><text x=\"45\" y=\"229\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"276\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">산소 분압 (mmHg)</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"30\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">포화도 (%)</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M75.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M163.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"163.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M251.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M339.0 225 v