\" d=\"M207 50 V225\"></path><circle cx=\"207\" cy=\"137.5\" r=\"6\" class=\"fig-accent\"></circle><circle cx=\"207\" cy=\"169.87105001806557\" r=\"6\" class=\"fig-danger\"></circle></svg></figure><figure class=\"figure\"><svg id=\"widget-o2-static-2\" viewbox=\"0 0 560 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"두 산소 해리 곡선에서 40 mmHg를 비교\"><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M75 50 V225 H515\"></path><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M75 50 H68 M75 137.5 H68 M75 225 H68\"></path><text x=\"45\" y=\"54\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><text x=\"45\" y=\"142\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50</text><text x=\"45\" y=\"229\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"276\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">산소 분압 (mmHg)</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"30\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">포화도 (%)</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M75.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M163.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"163.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M251.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M339.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"339.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M427.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"427.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">80</text><path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M515.0 225 v6\"></path><text x=\"515.0\" y=\"248\" class=\"fig-text\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><path class=\"fig-accent\" d=\"M75.00 225.00 L83.80 224.88 L92.60 224.24 L101.40 222.76 L110.2